    "description": "<p>A Quarterstaff is made of wood, plasteel, or a metal alloy. A user can strike with either end of the Quarterstaff, taking full advantage of any openings in an opponent's defenses. </p><p>A Quarterstaff is a Double Weapon. You can attack with both ends of the weapon as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>, but both attack rolls take a -10 penalty; certain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> can reduce these penalties. </p>",
